  "primary_typology": "Xinjiang & Critical Minerals",
  "executive_rationale": "China's largest silicon-metal producer. CBP issued a Withhold Release Order on its silica-based products after finding forced-labour indicators, and its Shanshan (Xinjiang) subsidiary is on the UFLPA Entity List. Sayari shows 100% ownership of Xinjiang subsidiaries and 854 outbound shipments, including to the United States. This is critical-minerals supply-chain exposure a federal buyer could inherit through a supplier.[^S45][^S46][^S41]"
